    - target: {fileID: 1253161411824071964, guid: 50fe8fa53408c3d45b668daabee7b142, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\u2022 The sorting station is designed to \r\ndemonstrate sorting methods
        of products \r\nwhich used in real-life industrial plants.\r\n\n\u2022 Sorting
        system sorts the workpieces and \r\nmoves them via an electrical conveyor
        \r\nbelt. \r\n\n\u2022 This station includes optical sensors to \r\ndetect
        falling parts at each pocket\r.\n\n\u2022 The sorting station is used to
        sort the samples \r\naccording to the analysis of the work piece \r\ncharacteristic.\r\n\n\u2022
        The station is being used to sort the sample \r\nin different pockets according
        to each \r\nsample characteristics.\n\r\n\u2022 Two contact-less sensors
        are used to detect \r\nthe sample at the start of the conveyor \r\nsystem
        and the end of the conveyor system."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
